WEBVTT

00:00.640 --> 00:01.280
Young General Zu,

00:01.360 --> 00:03.200
Since you have such an elegant mood,

00:03.280 --> 00:05.613
I shall venture to perform for you.

00:07.600 --> 00:09.000
Please.

00:16.520 --> 00:17.920
Hearing Your Highness call me "Young General Zu"

00:18.000 --> 00:19.400
Sounds rather pleasant.

00:19.600 --> 00:21.000
In the army camps,

00:21.320 --> 00:23.987
I rarely hear anyone address me so gently.

00:24.280 --> 00:26.280
Then what do they call you?

00:26.400 --> 00:27.800
On ordinary days,

00:27.880 --> 00:29.547
They call me "Junior General."

00:29.680 --> 00:31.080
Once on the training grounds,

00:31.160 --> 00:32.827
They call me "Boss Lady."
